<title>BRAZIL: Brazil calls briefing, expected on CVRD.</title>
<headline>Brazil calls briefing, expected on CVRD.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Planning Minister Antonio Kandir will hold a news conference at 6 p.m. (2100 GMT), a spokesman for the National Development Bank (BNDES) said.</p>
<p>In Brasilia, Presidency officials said BNDES president Luiz Carlos Mendonca de Barros would also hold a briefing.</p>
<p>Kandir and Mendonca de Barros were expected to talk about the auction of Companhia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD), which had been due to take place Tuesday but has been hampered by court injunctions.</p>
<p>((-- Michael Christie, Rio newsroom 55-21-5074151))</p>
